<title>JAPAN: Hokuriku Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokuriku Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   144.49		vs	  179.08</p>
<p> Operating	   23.23		vs	   29.48</p>
<p> Current		4.77		vs	    5.52</p>
<p> Net		    4.98		vs	    2.45</p>
